# Lights out: the LATCH_CLK Trace from U6 pin 13 (4Y) to U7 pin 11 (CLK) is cracked: U7's clock floats
# high and never rises, so the latch keeps the 0s RES_N cleared it to. The program runs as usual.
machine led_computer
title "Lights out"
brief "The LEDs never light."
fault crack U6.4Y U7.CLK 50%
